---
layout: "base.njk"
title: "Contact Us | Book a Free Discovery Call"
description: "Book a free 30-minute discovery call or send a message. We'll map your biggest growth leak and show you what to fix first. Remote across the US."
breadcrumbName: "Contact"
---
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="crumb">// Contact</span>
      <h1>Let's build your growth engine</h1>
      <p>Book a free discovery call or send a message. We usually reply within one business day.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="booking" id="booking">
        <div class="booking-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">// Free 30-minute call</span>
          <h2>Grab a time that suits you</h2>
          <p>Pick a slot and we'll map your biggest growth leak live &mdash; no pressure, no prep needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="booking-embed" id="bookingEmbed">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="bookingLoad">Open the scheduler
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 2v4M16 2v4M3 10h18M5 4h14a2 2 0 012 2v13a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2z"/></svg>
          </button>
          <p class="booking-hint">Loads securely from Cal.com when you're ready.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-grid">
        <div class="c-info">
          <span class="eyebrow">// Get in touch</span>
          <h2>Tell us where you want to grow</h2>
          <p>Share a little about your business and your biggest bottleneck. We'll come back with clear, honest next steps &mdash; no pressure, no jargon.</p>
          <div class="c-methods">
            <a href="mailto:info@ebusinessinnovators.com" class="c-method">
              <div class="c-mi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6"/></svg></div>
              <div><div class="cm-lbl">Email</div><div class="cm-val">info@ebusinessinnovators.com</div></div>
            </a>
            <a href="tel:+16507614126" class="c-method">
              <div class="c-mi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 01-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 01-8.6-3 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.8 19.8 0 01-3-8.6A2 2 0 014.1 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.7c.1.9.3 1.8.6 2.7a2 2 0 01-.5 2.1L10 10a16 16 0 006 6l1.5-1.2a2 2 0 012.1-.5c.9.3 1.8.5 2.7.6a2 2 0 011.7 2z"/></svg></div>
              <div><div class="cm-lbl">Phone</div><div class="cm-val">+1 (650) 761-4126</div></div>
            </a>
            <div class="c-method">
              <div class="c-mi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 12-9 12s-9-5-9-12a9 9 0 0118 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div>
              <div><div class="cm-lbl">Serving</div><div class="cm-val">Remote &mdash; clients across the US &amp; beyond</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="cm-lbl" style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px">Follow us</div>
            <div class="socials">
              <a class="soc" data-social="facebook" aria-label="Facebook"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M14 9V7c0-1 .3-1.5 1.6-1.5H18V2h-3c-3 0-4.4 1.6-4.4 4.3V9H8v3.5h2.6V22H14v-9.5h2.7L17 9z"/></svg></a>
              <a class="soc" data-social="linkedin" aria-label="LinkedIn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M4.98 3.5a2.5 2.5 0 100 5 2.5 2.5 0 000-5zM3 9h4v12H3zM10 9h3.8v1.7h.1c.5-1 1.8-2 3.7-2 4 0 4.7 2.6 4.7 6V21h-4v-5.3c0-1.3 0-2.9-1.8-2.9s-2 1.4-2 2.8V21h-4z"/></svg></a>
              <a class="soc" data-social="instagram" aria-label="Instagram"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></a>
              <a class="soc" data-social="x" aria-label="X"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.9 2H22l-7.5 8.6L23 22h-6.8l-5.3-7-6.1 7H1.7l8-9.2L1 2h7l4.8 6.3zm-2.4 18h1.9L7.6 4H5.6z"/></svg></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="c-form">
          <h3>Send us a message</h3>
          <p class="fsub">Fill this in and we'll be in touch within one business day.</p>
          <form id="contactForm" name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" novalidate>
            <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
            <p class="hp" hidden><label>Don&rsquo;t fill this out if you&rsquo;re human: <input name="bot-field"></label></p>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="name">Name</label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Jane Cooper" required>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="jane@yourbusiness.com" required>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+1 (555) 000-0000">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="message">Message</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us about your business and what you'd like to grow..." required></textarea>
            </div>
            <label class="consent">
              <input type="checkbox" id="consent" name="consent" required>
              <span>I agree to the <a href="/privacy.html">privacy policy</a> and consent to being contacted about my enquiry.</span>
            </label>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;justify-content:center">Send message
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 2L11 13M22 2l-7 20-4-9-9-4z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="form-msg" id="formMsg" role="status" aria-live="polite"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Thanks! Your message has been sent &mdash; we'll be in touch within one business day.</div>
            <div class="form-msg err" id="formErr" role="alert"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 8v5M12 16h.01"/></svg>Sorry, something went wrong sending your message. Please email us directly at info@ebusinessinnovators.com.</div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="map-wrap map-static">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 1180 340" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" role="img" aria-label="Remote-first — serving clients across the US and beyond">
          <defs><radialGradient id="ebiGlow" cx="50%" cy="42%" r="70%"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#0F7D5A" stop-opacity=".28"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#071A15" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs>
          <rect width="1180" height="340" fill="url(#ebiGlow)"/>
          <g fill="none" stroke="rgba(198,249,78,.16)" stroke-width="1.2">
            <circle cx="590" cy="176" r="150"/>
            <ellipse cx="590" cy="176" rx="150" ry="52"/>
            <ellipse cx="590" cy="176" rx="150" ry="108"/>
            <ellipse cx="590" cy="176" rx="58" ry="150"/>
            <ellipse cx="590" cy="176" rx="112" ry="150"/>
            <line x1="440" y1="176" x2="740" y2="176"/>
          </g>
          <g stroke="rgba(198,249,78,.45)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="4 6" fill="none">
            <path d="M505 140 Q580 108 645 205"/><path d="M645 205 Q705 150 695 122"/>
          </g>
          <g fill="#C6F94E">
            <circle cx="505" cy="140" r="5"/><circle cx="645" cy="205" r="5"/><circle cx="695" cy="122" r="4"/>
          </g>
        </svg>
        <div class="map-cap"><span class="mono">// Remote-first</span><strong>Serving clients across the US &amp; beyond</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
